---Create Submerchant
---
---Create a sub-merchant under your account and pre-fill its onboarding
---application. `merchantId` and `email` become the sub-merchant's identity
---and account owner; every other field is optional and is shown to the
---sub-merchant pre-filled when it opens onboarding. Fields that don't
---apply to the sub-merchant are accepted and kept, but not shown.
---Unknown fields are rejected.
---
---Limited to 30 sub-merchants per hour per API key.
---
---`POST /submerchant`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input coinflow.sub_merchant.CreateSubmerchantRequest
---@return coinflow.sub_merchant.CreateSubmerchantResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_submerchant(input) end

---Get Submerchant Onboarding Token
---
---Mint a short-lived onboarding token that authorizes creating a
---submerchant or seller under the authenticated merchant. The token embeds
---the caller's own merchantId as the parent — it cannot be minted for
---another merchant.
---
---`POST /submerchant/onboarding-token`
---@param input? coinflow.sub_merchant.GetOnboardingTokenRequest
---@return coinflow.sub_merchant.SubMerchantGetOnboardingTokenResponse200? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_onboarding_token(input) end

---Get Submerchant by ID
---
---`GET /submerchant/{submerchantId}`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input coinflow.sub_merchant.GetSubmerchantRequest
---@return coinflow.sub_merchant.ExternalMerchantResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_submerchant(input) end

---Get All Submerchants
---
---`GET /submerchant`
---@param input? coinflow.sub_merchant.GetSubmerchantsRequest
---@return coinflow.sub_merchant.GetSubmerchantsResponseBodyList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_submerchants(input) end

---Update Submerchant
---
---Update a sub-merchant's pre-filled onboarding application. Only the
---fields in the body change; `websiteUrls` and `developmentUrls` replace
---the whole list. Fails with 409 once the sub-merchant has submitted its
---application.
---
---`PATCH /submerchant/{submerchantId}`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input coinflow.sub_merchant.UpdateSubmerchantRequest
---@return coinflow.sub_merchant.PatchSubmerchantResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_submerchant(input) end

